Resources directory placeholder. The actual review-tunnel.json (containing
production VLESS + Reality credentials) is gitignored and must be copied
in manually on the build machine before archiving.

KNOWN-GOOD CONFIG: redfluent-singbox-ios-split-v3.json
(verified working — VLESS + Reality + xtls-rprx-vision + utls chrome,
DNS via Cloudflare DoH, SG bank/gov direct, China/sensitive sites via proxy)

On the cloud Mac:
  cp /path/to/redfluent-vpn/secrets/redfluent-singbox-ios-split-v3.json \
     ~/Projects/redfluent-vpn-ios/Tunnel/Resources/review-tunnel.json

PacketTunnelProvider loads this JSON via Bundle.main.url(forResource:withExtension:).
